WEBVTT

1
00:00:46,004 --> 00:00:48,257
[suspenseful music playing]

2
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:54,346
{\an8}[Jerrod] Kitana...

3
00:00:54,429 --> 00:00:55,639
I have something for you.

4
00:00:56,765 --> 00:00:57,891
It will protect you.

5
00:00:59,768 --> 00:01:01,478
It's beautiful, Father.

6
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:05,399
This was a gift from Lord Raiden.

7
00:01:05,482 --> 00:01:06,608
The God of Thunder.

8
00:01:08,193 --> 00:01:10,529
If anything were to happen to me,

9
00:01:10,612 --> 00:01:12,447
he's always listening.

10
00:01:19,788 --> 00:01:22,040
{\an8}[guard] Shao Kahn
is arriving, Your Majesty.

11
00:01:22,124 --> 00:01:24,293
What happens if you lose?

12
00:01:25,711 --> 00:01:27,004
[Jerrod] Don't worry about that.

13
00:01:27,087 --> 00:01:28,964
{\an8}But what if he's too strong?

14
00:01:29,047 --> 00:01:30,799
{\an8}Strength is not a closed fist.

15
00:01:31,425 --> 00:01:32,718
Strength is here,

16
00:01:33,844 --> 00:01:34,720
and here.

17
00:01:38,181 --> 00:01:39,600
Be strong, Kitana.

18
00:01:40,267 --> 00:01:41,518
[Jerrod sighs]

19
00:01:46,815 --> 00:01:51,194
[citizens chanting]
Jerrod, our king! Jerrod, our king!

20
00:01:51,695 --> 00:01:53,905
[chanting continues]

21
00:02:06,293 --> 00:02:09,171
[Kitana] <i>Shao Kahn, Emperor of Outworld,</i>

22
00:02:09,254 --> 00:02:12,341
<i>sought to unite the various realms
under one rule.</i>

23
00:02:12,883 --> 00:02:13,842
<i>His.</i>

24
00:02:15,552 --> 00:02:18,722
<i>But the Elder Gods had put
certain precautions in place.</i>

25
00:02:21,683 --> 00:02:24,936
<i>Our fates would not be settled
by the size of our armies.</i>

26
00:02:27,189 --> 00:02:30,817
<i>They would be decided by combat.</i>

27
00:02:31,860 --> 00:02:33,320
<i>The rules were simple.</i>

28
00:02:34,112 --> 00:02:37,407
<i>If one realm could win
ten tournaments in a row,</i>

29
00:02:37,491 --> 00:02:40,118
<i>it would be given
dominion over the other.</i>

30
00:02:40,786 --> 00:02:44,081
<i>Outworld would be allowed
to pillage Edenia's resources.</i>

31
00:02:45,582 --> 00:02:47,250
<i>Enslave our people.</i>

32
00:02:51,672 --> 00:02:55,217
<i>This was the final tournament.
Our last chance.</i>

33
00:02:56,134 --> 00:02:59,096
<i>All of our greatest warriors
had already fallen.</i>

34
00:03:00,681 --> 00:03:02,265
<i>Only one fighter remained.</i>

35
00:03:03,100 --> 00:03:04,267
<i>My father,</i>

36
00:03:05,894 --> 00:03:07,854
<i>King Jerrod of Edenia.</i>

37
00:03:09,439 --> 00:03:12,401
<i>But he faced Outworld's
greatest warrior.</i>

38
00:03:14,611 --> 00:03:16,738
<i>Shao Kahn himself.</i>

39
00:03:18,824 --> 00:03:20,158
[gasps softly]

40
00:03:22,411 --> 00:03:24,621
[footsteps thudding]

41
00:03:25,539 --> 00:03:27,082
[growls]

42
00:03:27,165 --> 00:03:30,168
They will never bow to you.

43
00:03:31,336 --> 00:03:32,963
[Shao Kahn] We shall see.

44
00:03:33,046 --> 00:03:35,132
[gong tolls]

45
00:03:36,967 --> 00:03:38,802
[tense music playing]

46
00:03:43,014 --> 00:03:44,182
[growls]

47
00:03:46,143 --> 00:03:47,519
[weapons clanging]

48
00:03:50,439 --> 00:03:51,857
- [Jerrod straining]
- [grunting]

49
00:03:53,942 --> 00:03:55,861
- [Jerrod yells]
- [thuds]

50
00:04:01,825 --> 00:04:03,410
[growls]

51
00:04:03,493 --> 00:04:04,411
- [thuds]
- [citizens exclaim]

52
00:04:14,087 --> 00:04:14,921
[Jerrod yells]

53
00:04:17,007 --> 00:04:18,759
[gasps]

54
00:04:18,842 --> 00:04:20,343
[groaning]

55
00:04:29,519 --> 00:04:30,520
Never!

56
00:04:39,905 --> 00:04:41,656
[weapon clatters]

57
00:04:41,740 --> 00:04:43,241
[blade slicing]

58
00:04:43,325 --> 00:04:44,618
[young Kitana gasps]

59
00:04:47,537 --> 00:04:50,040
- [grunts loudly]
- [Shao Kahn screams]

60
00:04:52,042 --> 00:04:53,794
- [blade slices]
- [Shao Kahn groans]

61
00:05:00,091 --> 00:05:02,844
[Jerrod strains, screams]

62
00:05:02,928 --> 00:05:04,346
[citizens gasping]

63
00:05:06,389 --> 00:05:07,808
[screams]

64
00:05:11,228 --> 00:05:13,313
[ominous music playing]

65
00:05:19,319 --> 00:05:20,821
[Jerrod grunting]

66
00:05:23,114 --> 00:05:24,991
[screaming]

67
00:05:26,284 --> 00:05:27,828
[gasps] Kitana, close your eyes.

68
00:05:28,703 --> 00:05:30,539
Close your eyes right now.

69
00:05:30,622 --> 00:05:31,957
[pained groans]

70
00:05:34,042 --> 00:05:35,877
[breathing heavily]

71
00:05:39,798 --> 00:05:41,299
[yells in pain]

72
00:05:44,261 --> 00:05:47,138
- [screams]
- No!

73
00:05:47,222 --> 00:05:49,099
No!

74
00:05:49,182 --> 00:05:51,434
[struggling]

75
00:05:51,518 --> 00:05:54,563
No! [sobbing]

76
00:05:55,647 --> 00:05:57,649
[screaming]

77
00:06:00,068 --> 00:06:02,445
[somber music playing]

78
00:06:03,071 --> 00:06:04,072
[thuds]

79
00:06:05,657 --> 00:06:07,617
[breath trembling]

80
00:06:11,329 --> 00:06:13,164
[crying]

81
00:06:17,669 --> 00:06:19,713
[women crying]

82
00:06:23,091 --> 00:06:24,551
[growls]

83
00:06:25,343 --> 00:06:28,680
[Shao Kahn] Edenia now belongs to me.

84
00:06:28,763 --> 00:06:30,682
[sinister music playing]

85
00:06:49,659 --> 00:06:50,952
[dagger clanks]

86
00:06:51,036 --> 00:06:53,038
- [grunting]
- [blade clanging]

87
00:06:54,456 --> 00:06:55,415
[Sindel growls]

88
00:07:04,758 --> 00:07:05,842
[Sindel grunts]

89
00:07:06,968 --> 00:07:09,888
[Shao Kahn] Kneel. Or you'll die.

90
00:07:27,948 --> 00:07:30,617
[mournful music playing]

91
00:08:08,655 --> 00:08:10,699
[foreboding music playing]

92
00:08:17,580 --> 00:08:20,041
Your father shouldn't have
brought you here.

93
00:08:31,761 --> 00:08:34,472
Kitana, you're my daughter now.

94
00:08:42,564 --> 00:08:44,607
[dramatic choral music playing]

95
00:08:48,820 --> 00:08:49,904
[woman] Kitana!

96
00:08:49,988 --> 00:08:51,781
[thrilling music playing]

97
00:08:52,365 --> 00:08:54,367
[both grunting]

98
00:08:56,411 --> 00:08:57,829
[panting]

99
00:08:59,497 --> 00:09:01,249
[weapons clacking]

100
00:09:04,002 --> 00:09:05,503
[Kitana grunts]

101
00:09:23,521 --> 00:09:25,398
[thrilling music stops]

102
00:09:26,691 --> 00:09:27,525
Yield.

103
00:09:44,542 --> 00:09:45,627
[ribbon snaps]

104
00:09:47,462 --> 00:09:49,172
You cannot be serious.

105
00:09:49,881 --> 00:09:52,217
You're the one who taught me,
everything's a weapon.

106
00:09:54,677 --> 00:09:56,513
[thrilling music resumes]

107
00:09:59,182 --> 00:10:00,308
[woman grunts]

108
00:10:00,850 --> 00:10:02,143
You yield.

109
00:10:16,574 --> 00:10:17,659
What do you have there?

110
00:10:18,243 --> 00:10:19,369
It's nothing.

111
00:10:21,121 --> 00:10:22,038
Jade.

112
00:10:24,374 --> 00:10:25,917
It was 20 years ago today

113
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:28,002
the Emperor named me as your bodyguard.

114
00:10:29,337 --> 00:10:31,756
I know what Shao Kahn took from you.

115
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:33,883
And if you had been vicious
or cruel to me,

116
00:10:33,967 --> 00:10:35,260
no one would have blamed you,

117
00:10:35,343 --> 00:10:37,929
but you treated me like family.

118
00:10:39,013 --> 00:10:40,140
Like a sister.

119
00:10:42,267 --> 00:10:43,726
You are my sister.

120
00:10:44,727 --> 00:10:46,437
In every way that matters.

121
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:53,111
Um, I got you something.
For the tournament.

122
00:10:58,074 --> 00:10:59,742
I was told that a proper princess

123
00:10:59,826 --> 00:11:02,871
is supposed to sit around
on pillows, fanning herself.

124
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,165
Then I thought

125
00:11:05,874 --> 00:11:08,626
you are not exactly the pillow type.

126
00:11:08,710 --> 00:11:10,044
[clanking]

127
00:11:13,214 --> 00:11:14,716
These are amazing.

128
00:11:17,844 --> 00:11:19,846
[suspenseful music playing]

129
00:11:27,812 --> 00:11:28,980
Hello, Mother.

130
00:11:30,231 --> 00:11:33,109
[Shao Kahn] I was beginning
to think you were avoiding me.

131
00:11:33,735 --> 00:11:36,321
I've been busy.
Training for the tournament.

132
00:11:38,072 --> 00:11:40,116
[Shao Kahn] Good.
Because I have petitioned

133
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:42,202
the Elder Gods
for the tournament to begin.

134
00:11:42,994 --> 00:11:45,538
Let Raiden scrounge
for his little champions.

135
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:48,249
They will simply be the first to die

136
00:11:48,875 --> 00:11:50,168
and Earthrealm will be mine.

137
00:11:50,919 --> 00:11:52,503
- [gasps]
- [door opens]

138
00:11:57,091 --> 00:11:58,218
[Kitana] Why is he here?

139
00:11:58,801 --> 00:12:00,845
[Shao Kahn] I have a task
for Shang Tsung.

140
00:12:02,180 --> 00:12:04,849
I hope you bring good news, Sorcerer.

141
00:12:04,933 --> 00:12:06,935
My spies have located the relic.

142
00:12:07,977 --> 00:12:09,938
It was last seen in Raiden's temple

143
00:12:10,021 --> 00:12:12,523
where it was stolen
by the mercenary, Kano.

144
00:12:13,566 --> 00:12:15,276
[Shao Kahn]
We seek the Amulet of Shinnok.

145
00:12:16,236 --> 00:12:18,696
[Sindel] It is said the amulet
can heal any wound.

146
00:12:18,780 --> 00:12:21,324
Transform a man into a god.

147
00:12:21,407 --> 00:12:22,951
To charge the amulet would require

148
00:12:23,034 --> 00:12:25,161
an impossible amount of power.

149
00:12:25,245 --> 00:12:27,830
We would need to capture
a star from the heavens.

150
00:12:27,914 --> 00:12:30,959
- A star...
- [dramatic music playing]

151
00:12:31,042 --> 00:12:32,377
...or a god.

152
00:12:33,544 --> 00:12:35,797
[Raiden] Outworld has issued
their challenge

153
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:37,507
and the Elder Gods have spoken.

154
00:12:37,590 --> 00:12:41,177
When the sand is gone,
the first round will begin.

155
00:12:42,178 --> 00:12:44,055
Mortal Kombat is upon us

156
00:12:44,764 --> 00:12:48,101
and yet we are still short one champion.

157
00:12:49,519 --> 00:12:51,437
[static]

158
00:12:59,737 --> 00:13:02,991
- [tires screeching]
- [suspenseful music playing]

159
00:13:07,453 --> 00:13:08,579
["Rock You Like A Hurricane"
by Scorpions playing]

160
00:13:08,663 --> 00:13:10,373
[singer]
♪ <i>Here I am</i> ♪

161
00:13:11,124 --> 00:13:16,254
♪ <i>Rock you like a hurricane</i> ♪

162
00:13:42,363 --> 00:13:44,073
It's showtime.

163
00:13:46,034 --> 00:13:47,076
[man screams]

164
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:49,037
["Rock You Like A Hurricane"
continues playing]

165
00:13:50,038 --> 00:13:51,247
♪ <i>Are you ready, baby?</i> ♪

166
00:14:01,382 --> 00:14:02,717
♪ <i>Here I am</i> ♪

167
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:03,801
[grunts]

168
00:14:03,885 --> 00:14:07,013
♪ <i>Rock you like a hurricane</i> ♪

169
00:14:08,431 --> 00:14:09,557
[steel rod thudding]

170
00:14:09,640 --> 00:14:11,642
♪ <i>Here I am</i> ♪

171
00:14:11,726 --> 00:14:13,353
♪ <i>Rock you like a hurricane</i> ♪

172
00:14:13,436 --> 00:14:14,562
[growls]

173
00:14:19,609 --> 00:14:22,153
[singer vocalizing]

174
00:14:24,072 --> 00:14:26,324
[Johnny] You should have
brought more guys.

175
00:14:26,407 --> 00:14:27,617
♪ <i>The sun comes out</i> ♪

176
00:14:27,700 --> 00:14:31,871
♪ <i>Last night was shaking
And pretty loud</i> ♪

177
00:14:32,622 --> 00:14:33,831
[Johnny grunts]

178
00:14:33,915 --> 00:14:35,958
♪ <i>It scratches my skin</i> ♪

179
00:14:36,042 --> 00:14:39,629
♪ <i>So what is wrong with another sin?</i> ♪

180
00:14:45,927 --> 00:14:47,887
♪ <i>Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah</i> ♪

181
00:14:47,970 --> 00:14:49,347
♪ <i>Here I am</i> ♪

182
00:14:50,390 --> 00:14:52,975
♪ <i>Rock you like a hurricane</i> ♪

183
00:14:53,059 --> 00:14:55,395
♪ <i>Come on, come on
Come on, come on</i> ♪

184
00:14:55,478 --> 00:14:57,105
[explosion]

185
00:14:58,147 --> 00:14:59,524
[singer]
♪ <i>Rock you like a hurricane</i> ♪

186
00:14:59,607 --> 00:15:01,484
[man 1] Man, Johnny Cage
got old as fuck.

187
00:15:01,567 --> 00:15:04,612
- [snoring]
- [girls shrieking]

188
00:15:07,532 --> 00:15:08,741
{\an8}[announcer over speakers]
<i>Attention fans,</i>

189
00:15:08,825 --> 00:15:11,494
{\an8}<i>don't miss your chance to meet
your favorite influencers</i>

190
00:15:11,577 --> 00:15:14,288
{\an8}<i>and YouTube stars in Autograph Alley.</i>

191
00:15:14,372 --> 00:15:15,957
{\an8}[woman] All right,
everyone, get in close.

192
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:17,125
{\an8}Black Orchid!

193
00:15:17,208 --> 00:15:19,127
[girls cheering]

194
00:15:20,128 --> 00:15:21,921
[upbeat dance music
playing over speakers]

195
00:15:27,260 --> 00:15:28,428
[Johnny] <i>It's showtime.</i>

196
00:15:44,444 --> 00:15:45,445
Johnny Cage.

197
00:15:46,279 --> 00:15:48,239
Hey, guys. I'm off the clock.

198
00:15:49,365 --> 00:15:52,869
Mr. Cage, you have been chosen
for Mortal Kombat.

199
00:15:52,952 --> 00:15:54,871
Mortal Kombat, huh?

200
00:15:54,954 --> 00:15:56,998
What's that? Some kind of fan film?

201
00:15:57,081 --> 00:15:58,916
It's a fighting tournament.

202
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:01,586
[sighs] Yeah, not really
my thing anymore.

203
00:16:03,838 --> 00:16:05,047
Unless it's a paying gig?

204
00:16:05,590 --> 00:16:08,092
More like a
"fate of the entire human race" gig.

205
00:16:08,176 --> 00:16:10,470
Tell me you're not some crazy fans.

206
00:16:11,053 --> 00:16:12,346
Definitely not fans.

207
00:16:12,430 --> 00:16:13,389
All right. All right.

208
00:16:13,473 --> 00:16:14,724
You don't have to say "definitely."

209
00:16:14,807 --> 00:16:15,808
You have been chosen

210
00:16:15,892 --> 00:16:17,643
as one of the champions of Earthrealm.

211
00:16:18,394 --> 00:16:21,063
The gods have selected you, Mr. Cage.

212
00:16:21,939 --> 00:16:24,442
All right, I think it's time
for you guys to fuck off.

213
00:16:24,525 --> 00:16:26,652
But, hey, love the cosplay. What's that?

214
00:16:26,736 --> 00:16:28,946
<i>Big Trouble in Little China?</i>
Fantastic film.

215
00:16:29,030 --> 00:16:30,323
Listen, I know what it sounds like,

216
00:16:30,406 --> 00:16:31,866
but he's telling the truth.

217
00:16:31,949 --> 00:16:35,119
Very soon the champions
will be summoned to fight

218
00:16:35,203 --> 00:16:36,621
and you will be among them.

219
00:16:36,704 --> 00:16:38,331
The fate of your world

220
00:16:38,414 --> 00:16:40,291
rests on the outcome of this tournament.

221
00:16:41,042 --> 00:16:43,586
Fantastic. I will see you there.

222
00:16:43,669 --> 00:16:45,463
Thanks for coming, drive safe,

223
00:16:45,546 --> 00:16:47,548
and, uh, say hi to Dumbledore for me.

224
00:16:47,632 --> 00:16:49,175
You're gonna have to show him.

225
00:16:53,346 --> 00:16:54,347
[crackling]

226
00:17:03,814 --> 00:17:05,274
Holy shit.

227
00:17:06,025 --> 00:17:07,485
How are you doing that?

228
00:17:07,568 --> 00:17:09,320
[Raiden] Come with us, Mr. Cage,

229
00:17:09,403 --> 00:17:12,031
and discover the man
you were meant to be.

230
00:17:18,621 --> 00:17:20,206
Now, are you coming or what?

231
00:17:25,711 --> 00:17:27,713
[mysterious music playing]

232
00:17:45,773 --> 00:17:46,983
Where the hell am I?

233
00:17:48,776 --> 00:17:50,695
[Sonya] It's okay.
You're still on Earth.

234
00:17:50,778 --> 00:17:52,488
Welcome to Raiden's Sky Temple.

235
00:17:52,572 --> 00:17:54,907
[intriguing music playing]

236
00:17:54,991 --> 00:17:56,742
[all grunting]

237
00:17:59,078 --> 00:18:00,746
[Jax] Watch this. [grunts]

238
00:18:02,248 --> 00:18:05,042
Robot arms. That dude's got robot arms.

239
00:18:06,502 --> 00:18:07,962
[Sonya] We served in the Army together.

240
00:18:08,045 --> 00:18:09,839
That's Jax Briggs. Special Forces.

241
00:18:11,340 --> 00:18:12,550
That's Cole Young.

242
00:18:12,633 --> 00:18:14,927
His suit absorbs attacks
and makes him stronger.

243
00:18:15,886 --> 00:18:17,388
He's a descendant of Scorpion.

244
00:18:17,471 --> 00:18:19,432
One of Earthrealm's greatest warriors.

245
00:18:20,516 --> 00:18:21,559
Oh.

246
00:18:21,642 --> 00:18:22,768
That's Liu Kang.

247
00:18:23,603 --> 00:18:25,229
He's the best fighter we got.

248
00:18:33,613 --> 00:18:35,948
- He shoots fire?
- [Sonya] Mm-hmm.

249
00:18:36,032 --> 00:18:37,116
[scoffs]

250
00:18:37,992 --> 00:18:40,453
I feel like that's cheating, but okay.

251
00:18:41,662 --> 00:18:42,788
It kind of feels like bullshit

252
00:18:42,872 --> 00:18:44,540
that y'all have these crazy powers

253
00:18:44,624 --> 00:18:46,792
and I'm just, you know,
incredibly handsome.

254
00:18:48,085 --> 00:18:49,420
It could take months of training

255
00:18:49,503 --> 00:18:50,630
to unlock your powers.

256
00:18:51,339 --> 00:18:52,590
We don't have that kind of time.

257
00:18:52,673 --> 00:18:54,050
Yeah, well, whose fault is that?

258
00:18:54,133 --> 00:18:55,426
I mean, if you knew this was coming,

259
00:18:55,509 --> 00:18:57,178
why'd you wait
till the last second to find me?

260
00:18:57,261 --> 00:18:59,972
We used to have
another champion. Kung Lao.

261
00:19:00,056 --> 00:19:01,641
Oh, great, so I'm just the fucking sub.

262
00:19:01,724 --> 00:19:03,851
He was murdered. By Shang Tsung.

263
00:19:03,934 --> 00:19:06,103
Wait. Murdered?

264
00:19:07,855 --> 00:19:10,066
Come on. You can't be serious. Right?

265
00:19:10,608 --> 00:19:12,860
I mean, that's, like,
gotta be against the rules.

266
00:19:13,361 --> 00:19:15,321
You can't just go around killing people.

267
00:19:16,781 --> 00:19:19,283
It's called Mortal Kombat for a reason.

268
00:19:20,409 --> 00:19:23,788
Yo, Gandalf, send me back.
I wanna go back.

269
00:19:23,871 --> 00:19:26,165
- Johnny, wait.
- No. No.

270
00:19:26,248 --> 00:19:28,000
You said tournament which implies rules,

271
00:19:28,084 --> 00:19:30,169
and a referee, and I don't know,
maybe a medic.

272
00:19:30,252 --> 00:19:32,296
Not some fucking Squid Game
murder party.

273
00:19:32,380 --> 00:19:34,507
Dude wants to quit, just let him go.

274
00:19:34,590 --> 00:19:35,591
We don't need him.

275
00:19:35,675 --> 00:19:38,803
Look, you wanna step in the octagon

276
00:19:38,886 --> 00:19:40,429
with a bunch of happy assholes

277
00:19:40,513 --> 00:19:43,474
that don't know how to lose,
go right ahead.

278
00:19:43,557 --> 00:19:46,185
But I don't have Transformer arms,

279
00:19:46,268 --> 00:19:48,854
or shoot lightning bolts or fireballs,

280
00:19:48,938 --> 00:19:51,399
or do whatever the fuck it is
Flame Fingers does,

281
00:19:51,482 --> 00:19:54,318
so forgive me if I don't
sign up to get mulched.

282
00:19:58,280 --> 00:20:00,199
You are not wrong, Mr. Cage.

283
00:20:08,541 --> 00:20:10,292
Nine times, we have been challenged.

284
00:20:10,376 --> 00:20:12,169
And nine times, we have lost.

285
00:20:12,253 --> 00:20:14,046
And now, 20 years later,

286
00:20:14,130 --> 00:20:17,091
Shao Kahn seeks to add
Earthrealm to his dominion.

287
00:20:18,259 --> 00:20:21,053
This is a war
for the fate of your world.

288
00:20:22,221 --> 00:20:25,015
[Jax] Look, Cage, I get it. We all do.

289
00:20:25,099 --> 00:20:27,143
Some stupid fucking cosmic lottery

290
00:20:27,226 --> 00:20:29,895
decided that we're the ones
that get to save the world.

291
00:20:32,648 --> 00:20:34,191
Shit is terrifying.

292
00:20:34,817 --> 00:20:35,818
[Cole] You wanna know
the last thing I did

293
00:20:35,901 --> 00:20:36,902
before coming here?

294
00:20:36,986 --> 00:20:40,364
I said goodbye to my wife
and my little girl.

295
00:20:40,448 --> 00:20:43,617
The two most important things
in my life.

296
00:20:43,701 --> 00:20:45,077
And there's a damn good chance

297
00:20:45,161 --> 00:20:46,579
I'm never gonna see them again.

298
00:20:48,414 --> 00:20:49,457
And I'm okay with that.

299
00:20:50,875 --> 00:20:53,711
Because I know if I die out there,
I'm dying for them.

300
00:20:55,129 --> 00:20:57,840
We lose one more time,
the Earth is gone.

301
00:20:57,923 --> 00:21:00,426
[Liu Kang] And our only chance
is to face this together.

302
00:21:01,010 --> 00:21:05,389
You, Johnny Cage,
are a part of this now.

303
00:21:10,561 --> 00:21:14,273
[heroic music builds, stops]

304
00:21:14,356 --> 00:21:15,524
Fuck that.

305
00:21:15,608 --> 00:21:17,193
[Sonya] Johnny, even if you walk away,

306
00:21:17,276 --> 00:21:19,028
the Elder Gods
can still summon you to fight.

307
00:21:19,111 --> 00:21:20,196
Not if they can't find me.

308
00:21:20,279 --> 00:21:21,947
So what are you gonna do, huh?

309
00:21:22,031 --> 00:21:23,407
You just going to go hide?

310
00:21:23,491 --> 00:21:25,534
No, first I'm gonna drink
every beer on the planet,

311
00:21:25,618 --> 00:21:26,702
then I'm going to hide.

312
00:21:26,786 --> 00:21:28,537
Because this shit's
got nothing to do with me.

313
00:21:28,621 --> 00:21:30,623
I'm not some great warrior.

314
00:21:30,706 --> 00:21:32,208
I'm not some champion.

315
00:21:32,291 --> 00:21:34,335
Okay? I'm an actor.

316
00:21:34,418 --> 00:21:35,419
[Sonya] Hmm.

317
00:21:36,712 --> 00:21:38,005
And before that, you were the guy

318
00:21:38,088 --> 00:21:40,299
with five black belts and a world title.

319
00:21:42,301 --> 00:21:45,054
Yeah, I saw some of those old fights.

320
00:21:46,138 --> 00:21:49,350
Man, you could have been
one of the best.

321
00:21:49,433 --> 00:21:52,228
But I wasn't.
And that was a long time ago.

322
00:21:52,311 --> 00:21:55,105
That guy you want is dead and buried.

323
00:21:56,106 --> 00:21:58,359
Or maybe he's still in there,
trying to get out.

324
00:22:18,921 --> 00:22:19,922
Hey, listen...

325
00:22:22,007 --> 00:22:24,176
I'm like 90% sure I had an aneurysm

326
00:22:24,260 --> 00:22:26,595
and this is some kind of
fucked up coma dream,

327
00:22:28,764 --> 00:22:30,599
but on the off chance this shit is real,

328
00:22:32,309 --> 00:22:34,353
best of luck with the whole
saving the world thing.

329
00:22:39,817 --> 00:22:41,360
[thunderclap]

330
00:22:41,443 --> 00:22:43,112
[thunder rumbling]

331
00:22:47,074 --> 00:22:49,869
[voices whispering]

332
00:22:49,952 --> 00:22:53,122
[Quan Chi] You should know
that when you died,

333
00:22:53,205 --> 00:22:57,543
it was not your so-called friends
who brought you back.

334
00:22:58,711 --> 00:23:00,921
It was not Lord Raiden,

335
00:23:01,714 --> 00:23:03,591
the Great Pretender.

336
00:23:05,551 --> 00:23:07,595
It was Shao Kahn.

337
00:23:09,013 --> 00:23:10,681
Rise now,

338
00:23:11,557 --> 00:23:15,185
as a champion of Outworld.

339
00:23:15,269 --> 00:23:17,688
[ominous music builds]

340
00:23:21,817 --> 00:23:25,112
[Acolyte] Sire,
we retrieved the package.

341
00:23:27,531 --> 00:23:28,532
Quan Chi!

342
00:23:29,366 --> 00:23:31,827
I am told you sent your
followers to Earthrealm.

343
00:23:31,911 --> 00:23:33,078
What were they doing there?

344
00:23:33,162 --> 00:23:36,081
Simply retrieving
some lost property, my lady.

345
00:23:36,957 --> 00:23:38,751
By order of your father.

346
00:23:41,378 --> 00:23:42,379
What is that?

347
00:23:47,009 --> 00:23:48,802
[Quan Chi] I believe it's called...

348
00:23:49,720 --> 00:23:50,930
a "Kano."

349
00:23:55,976 --> 00:23:57,686
[man] One Sling Dog please.

350
00:24:00,481 --> 00:24:01,482
[gasps]

351
00:24:03,484 --> 00:24:04,652
You're Johnny Cage.

352
00:24:05,778 --> 00:24:07,446
That's what the tab says.

353
00:24:07,529 --> 00:24:09,073
[man] Holy shit.

354
00:24:09,615 --> 00:24:13,077
I freaking loved Citizen Cage
when I was a kid.

355
00:24:14,954 --> 00:24:16,538
Thanks, man. I appreciate it.

356
00:24:18,582 --> 00:24:20,000
Dude, you know what they should do?

357
00:24:21,293 --> 00:24:23,337
They should do another Citizen Cage.

358
00:24:23,420 --> 00:24:24,838
Like a reboot.

359
00:24:25,839 --> 00:24:27,758
Come on, man. Give me a break.

360
00:24:28,384 --> 00:24:29,259
Nobody wants that.

361
00:24:30,052 --> 00:24:30,886
What?

362
00:24:30,970 --> 00:24:32,137
You think the world is crying out

363
00:24:32,221 --> 00:24:35,265
for a Johnny Cage comeback? Huh?

364
00:24:36,183 --> 00:24:38,602
No. They want gritty,
they want grounded,

365
00:24:38,686 --> 00:24:39,603
they want Keanu Reeves

366
00:24:39,687 --> 00:24:41,855
murdering a thousand
fucking dudes with a pencil.

367
00:24:41,939 --> 00:24:43,774
That's what people wanna see.

368
00:24:45,693 --> 00:24:49,488
Not some dinosaur
doing a bunch of karate poses.

369
00:24:50,781 --> 00:24:52,533
That shit went out in the '90s.

370
00:24:56,662 --> 00:24:58,122
I thought it was pretty cool.

371
00:25:09,091 --> 00:25:10,384
[sighs]

372
00:25:19,268 --> 00:25:21,603
[Quan Chi chanting indistinctly]

373
00:25:24,857 --> 00:25:26,942
[unsettling music playing]

374
00:25:33,574 --> 00:25:35,576
[continues chanting]

375
00:25:38,037 --> 00:25:39,455
[Kano screams]

376
00:25:43,625 --> 00:25:45,377
Where's my fucking eye?

377
00:25:46,170 --> 00:25:47,880
- [squelching]
- [Kano grunts]

378
00:25:49,506 --> 00:25:50,591
Blondie.

379
00:25:52,009 --> 00:25:53,427
[Raiden] The tournament has begun.

380
00:25:54,428 --> 00:25:56,096
Today you fight for Earthrealm.

381
00:25:56,180 --> 00:25:58,265
For the lives of everyone
you have ever known.

382
00:25:58,348 --> 00:26:01,643
If you fail, the Earth fails with you.

383
00:26:02,352 --> 00:26:05,314
Two of our champions
will be chosen to compete today.

384
00:26:05,981 --> 00:26:06,982
The winners will advance

385
00:26:07,066 --> 00:26:08,776
to the next stage of the tournament.

386
00:26:09,401 --> 00:26:11,779
The losers will be eliminated.

387
00:26:11,862 --> 00:26:13,322
To the death.

388
00:26:13,405 --> 00:26:15,199
That is up to the winner.

389
00:26:16,158 --> 00:26:17,201
Maybe don't lose.

390
00:26:17,826 --> 00:26:19,369
[energy whooshing]

391
00:26:21,038 --> 00:26:22,039
[pulsing]

392
00:26:23,123 --> 00:26:25,292
Well, looks like it's my lucky day.

393
00:26:25,375 --> 00:26:27,419
Blade, you got this.

394
00:26:33,675 --> 00:26:35,511
I thought you said
two of us were fighting.

395
00:26:37,054 --> 00:26:39,098
[rock music playing over stereo]

396
00:26:40,265 --> 00:26:43,852
[announcer] <i>It's Johnny Cage
with a brutal hit. He's down.</i>

397
00:26:43,936 --> 00:26:45,854
- [whistle blows]
- [announcer] <i>It's official.</i>

398
00:26:45,938 --> 00:26:48,565
<i>Johnny Cage just became
the youngest minor</i>

399
00:26:48,649 --> 00:26:50,192
<i>to ever win this tournament.</i>

400
00:26:50,275 --> 00:26:52,778
<i>This young man
is destined for greatness.</i>

401
00:26:56,740 --> 00:26:58,283
[bartender] You seem
a little down, Johnny.

402
00:26:59,409 --> 00:27:01,245
You're normally a little more animated.

403
00:27:08,168 --> 00:27:09,586
<i>Uno más</i>, thanks, Ed.

404
00:27:13,173 --> 00:27:14,174
[zaps]

405
00:27:19,972 --> 00:27:21,306
[grunts]

406
00:27:29,982 --> 00:27:31,275
Oh, shit.

407
00:27:32,442 --> 00:27:34,611
[suspenseful music playing]

408
00:27:37,281 --> 00:27:38,448
I don't know what you're on about.

409
00:27:38,532 --> 00:27:39,658
The amulet of what now?

410
00:27:39,741 --> 00:27:41,618
Shinnok. Pay attention!

411
00:27:41,702 --> 00:27:43,287
Don't look at me
with that tone of voice,

412
00:27:43,370 --> 00:27:44,746
you big bleached dildo.

413
00:27:44,830 --> 00:27:47,583
I've just been dead.
And my fucking eye's AWOL.

414
00:27:47,666 --> 00:27:50,878
Stop your incessant whinging.
We can build you another.

415
00:27:50,961 --> 00:27:53,005
Why is he not a Revenant
like the rest of them?

416
00:27:53,088 --> 00:27:55,424
[Quan Chi] He was not worth
the time or the effort.

417
00:27:55,507 --> 00:27:58,135
This one barely has a soul
left to corrupt.

418
00:27:58,218 --> 00:28:00,554
Ha! You hear that? A fucking loophole.

419
00:28:00,637 --> 00:28:01,972
[laughs] Go, you good thing.

420
00:28:02,055 --> 00:28:05,225
Where is the amulet you took
from Raiden's temple?

421
00:28:05,309 --> 00:28:06,810
I don't know, probably in my pocket

422
00:28:06,894 --> 00:28:08,228
where I keep all the shit I steal.

423
00:28:09,938 --> 00:28:11,607
Oh, right-oh.

424
00:28:14,026 --> 00:28:17,404
- Here we go. How about...
- [metal clinking]

425
00:28:18,071 --> 00:28:20,032
Nah, different temple. Well, hold on.

426
00:28:20,949 --> 00:28:21,992
This could be...

427
00:28:22,492 --> 00:28:24,411
[chuckles] Yeah. Should call her.

428
00:28:25,370 --> 00:28:28,415
Ah! Here we are. Yahtzee.

429
00:28:29,041 --> 00:28:30,000
Oi!

430
00:28:30,083 --> 00:28:31,293
We could have left him dead.

431
00:28:31,376 --> 00:28:33,128
Hey! First off, fuck off.

432
00:28:33,212 --> 00:28:35,047
And you, where are you going with that?

433
00:28:36,298 --> 00:28:37,925
I will take it to my father.

434
00:28:39,259 --> 00:28:40,636
Unfortunately, Princess,

435
00:28:40,719 --> 00:28:43,055
