436
00:28:45,390 --> 00:28:46,975
Oi, you creepy fucking mime.

437
00:28:47,059 --> 00:28:48,936
I stole that fair and square.

438
00:28:50,312 --> 00:28:51,688
Good luck.

439
00:28:58,528 --> 00:29:00,489
[footsteps thudding]

440
00:29:04,159 --> 00:29:06,245
[thrilling music playing]

441
00:29:12,417 --> 00:29:14,294
[Kitana] Each flame
represents a fighter.

442
00:29:15,087 --> 00:29:16,588
The tournament ends when one side

443
00:29:16,672 --> 00:29:18,173
has no champions left.

444
00:29:19,049 --> 00:29:21,009
Hey. How's it going, babe?

445
00:29:21,093 --> 00:29:22,844
[blades clanking]

446
00:29:22,928 --> 00:29:25,347
Listen, I'm warning you,

447
00:29:26,348 --> 00:29:29,309
I got a Saturn Award
for best fight in a feature film,

448
00:29:29,393 --> 00:29:30,644
so don't mess with me.

449
00:29:31,144 --> 00:29:32,854
[gong tolls]

450
00:29:34,773 --> 00:29:37,317
Whoa! Whoa. Easy, all right?

451
00:29:37,401 --> 00:29:39,736
Let's just take a timeout here
and talk about it.

452
00:29:39,820 --> 00:29:42,572
Okay? I really don't feel
comfortable hitting a girl.

453
00:29:44,116 --> 00:29:46,410
Don't worry, you won't.

454
00:29:52,249 --> 00:29:54,042
[blades slashing]

455
00:29:55,961 --> 00:29:57,879
[both grunting]

456
00:29:57,963 --> 00:29:59,798
Whoa! Come on. Easy.
Let's just talk about this.

457
00:30:04,261 --> 00:30:06,138
- [grunts]
- [thuds]

458
00:30:22,779 --> 00:30:24,239
Why are you so fucking mean?

459
00:30:24,323 --> 00:30:25,449
[Kitana scoffs]

460
00:30:27,075 --> 00:30:29,286
[panting]

461
00:30:34,958 --> 00:30:36,793
[Johnny grunting]

462
00:30:49,598 --> 00:30:50,599
[both grunting]

463
00:30:51,516 --> 00:30:52,517
[Kitana grunts]

464
00:31:15,374 --> 00:31:16,583
[grunts]

465
00:31:19,628 --> 00:31:20,879
[sighs]

466
00:31:20,962 --> 00:31:22,923
[thrilling music continues]

467
00:31:38,522 --> 00:31:40,524
[blades slashing]

468
00:31:44,236 --> 00:31:45,237
[grunts]

469
00:31:48,407 --> 00:31:50,534
- [blades slash]
- [groans]

470
00:31:59,876 --> 00:32:00,877
[Johnny grunts]

471
00:32:06,508 --> 00:32:07,384
[groans]

472
00:32:16,560 --> 00:32:18,228
Finish him!

473
00:32:32,576 --> 00:32:33,577
Hmm.

474
00:32:49,468 --> 00:32:51,553
[suspenseful music playing]

475
00:32:57,767 --> 00:33:00,353
[Sindel] It appears your side
is already down a man.

476
00:33:01,563 --> 00:33:02,606
Tragic.

477
00:33:05,567 --> 00:33:06,610
And who are you?

478
00:33:07,110 --> 00:33:09,738
Sindel. High Queen of Edenia.

479
00:33:09,821 --> 00:33:12,115
Consort to the great Shao Kahn.

480
00:33:12,199 --> 00:33:14,117
They send their queen to fight?

481
00:33:14,618 --> 00:33:17,829
No. We send our best to fight.

482
00:33:17,913 --> 00:33:18,830
Oh.

483
00:33:19,581 --> 00:33:22,042
No offense, babe,
but you look really fucking dead.

484
00:33:22,125 --> 00:33:24,336
I was freed from my mortal bonds.

485
00:33:24,419 --> 00:33:25,545
Shao Kahn showed me

486
00:33:25,629 --> 00:33:27,297
the pleasures of a life eternal.

487
00:33:27,380 --> 00:33:28,965
- [gong tolls]
- [metal clanks]

488
00:33:31,968 --> 00:33:33,887
Perhaps I'll do the same for you.

489
00:33:33,970 --> 00:33:35,180
[metal clanking]

490
00:33:39,518 --> 00:33:40,393
[Sonya yells]

491
00:33:43,772 --> 00:33:45,065
What a pretty trick.

492
00:33:46,149 --> 00:33:47,692
Would you like to see mine?

493
00:33:48,568 --> 00:33:50,195
No, actually I'm good.

494
00:33:51,363 --> 00:33:53,615
- [grunts]
- [screaming]

495
00:33:58,036 --> 00:33:59,663
[yelling]

496
00:34:03,708 --> 00:34:04,793
[grunts]

497
00:34:04,876 --> 00:34:05,877
[metal slashing]

498
00:34:11,091 --> 00:34:13,218
[screaming]

499
00:34:13,301 --> 00:34:15,679
[Sonya] Fuck you! You stupid bitch!

500
00:34:18,890 --> 00:34:19,891
[grunts]

501
00:34:26,481 --> 00:34:27,482
[grunts]

502
00:34:29,150 --> 00:34:30,110
[groans]

503
00:34:33,113 --> 00:34:35,448
[both straining]

504
00:34:35,532 --> 00:34:36,449
[Sindel growling]

505
00:34:41,496 --> 00:34:43,456
[screaming]

506
00:34:44,207 --> 00:34:45,208
[thuds]

507
00:34:51,756 --> 00:34:53,758
[Sonya grunting]

508
00:35:00,056 --> 00:35:02,517
[both straining]

509
00:35:02,601 --> 00:35:04,394
[screaming]

510
00:35:10,483 --> 00:35:11,443
[Sonya grunts]

511
00:35:16,406 --> 00:35:17,407
[squelches]

512
00:35:19,659 --> 00:35:20,660
[panting]

513
00:35:22,621 --> 00:35:24,497
It appears our sides are now even.

514
00:35:30,086 --> 00:35:31,296
What'd I miss? [sighs]

515
00:35:32,005 --> 00:35:34,132
Fuck yeah! Look who's back.

516
00:35:36,092 --> 00:35:37,927
Well? How bad was it?

517
00:35:38,011 --> 00:35:41,723
Zombie queen. Pit of spikes. Yeah.

518
00:35:41,806 --> 00:35:43,308
- So pretty goddamn bad.
- Ow.

519
00:35:43,391 --> 00:35:45,352
- [Johnny groans]
- [Sonya grunts]

520
00:35:45,435 --> 00:35:46,645
- You okay?
- Yeah.

521
00:35:50,940 --> 00:35:52,067
What happened?

522
00:35:52,150 --> 00:35:54,444
You were eliminated from the tournament.

523
00:35:55,570 --> 00:35:56,655
You lost.

524
00:35:56,738 --> 00:35:59,532
You are lucky, she was charitable
and let you live.

525
00:36:07,457 --> 00:36:09,209
[Kano] Oi! Pennywise.

526
00:36:09,292 --> 00:36:11,503
I've been looking all over
this shithole for you.

527
00:36:11,586 --> 00:36:13,129
You promised me a new eye.

528
00:36:13,213 --> 00:36:14,839
And it better be one that shoots lasers.

529
00:36:15,382 --> 00:36:18,385
- I have other priorities.
- [Kano] Like fucking what?

530
00:36:18,468 --> 00:36:19,928
If it's putting on more eyeliner,

531
00:36:20,011 --> 00:36:21,471
trust me, you're good.

532
00:36:21,554 --> 00:36:22,847
All right? Come on, mate.

533
00:36:22,931 --> 00:36:25,392
I am bumping into shit
left, right, and center.

534
00:36:25,475 --> 00:36:27,185
I mean, my peripheral vision is fucked.

535
00:36:27,268 --> 00:36:29,020
Proper fucked, mate.

536
00:36:29,104 --> 00:36:31,022
So come on. Chop-chop. Let's get to it.

537
00:36:31,106 --> 00:36:32,691
[pulsing]

538
00:36:32,774 --> 00:36:34,150
Well, you don't have to do it right now.

539
00:36:34,234 --> 00:36:36,945
I mean, you need to,
you know, take a measurement.

540
00:36:37,028 --> 00:36:40,281
Check the color
or wash your grubby little hands.

541
00:36:43,576 --> 00:36:44,953
All right, let's have a look.

542
00:36:45,036 --> 00:36:47,956
Don't fucking roll it on
the fucking ground, you grub!

543
00:36:49,416 --> 00:36:51,126
Oi, the amulet.

544
00:36:51,793 --> 00:36:54,379
I want that back.
And don't fucking roll it.

545
00:36:54,462 --> 00:36:57,173
[Quan Chi] You got your eye.
Now leave me alone.

546
00:36:57,257 --> 00:36:59,426
The amulet does not belong to you.

547
00:36:59,968 --> 00:37:01,845
Its powers are well beyond

548
00:37:01,928 --> 00:37:03,722
- your meager understanding.
- [blows air]

549
00:37:03,805 --> 00:37:04,806
Idiot.

550
00:37:04,889 --> 00:37:07,100
All right. Let's take
this baby for a test drive.

551
00:37:07,851 --> 00:37:09,936
All right. [inhales deeply]

552
00:37:11,062 --> 00:37:15,316
One, two, three. Oh! Fuck! Snug.

553
00:37:16,067 --> 00:37:18,611
[zapping]

554
00:37:18,695 --> 00:37:20,697
Wow. [chuckles]

555
00:37:20,780 --> 00:37:23,116
Holy shit, is that HD?
That's pretty good.

556
00:37:23,199 --> 00:37:25,452
How many eyes you made?
Can you do me other one?

557
00:37:38,798 --> 00:37:40,633
You seem troubled, Mr. Cage.

558
00:37:42,469 --> 00:37:44,596
Yeah. Well, 'cause of me

559
00:37:44,679 --> 00:37:47,015
Earth's odds just got 20% worse.

560
00:37:47,724 --> 00:37:49,934
I had a chance to actually
do something worth a damn

561
00:37:50,018 --> 00:37:51,603
and I screwed it all up.

562
00:37:51,686 --> 00:37:55,774
So, yeah, I'd say "troubled"
just about sums it up.

563
00:37:56,733 --> 00:37:58,318
[rustling]

564
00:38:04,032 --> 00:38:07,076
What are those? Pills?

565
00:38:07,160 --> 00:38:08,495
Huh?

566
00:38:09,454 --> 00:38:10,872
Are they magic fighting pills?

567
00:38:11,956 --> 00:38:14,167
Is that...
Is that how you get your powers?

568
00:38:21,174 --> 00:38:22,717
[clattering]

569
00:38:23,551 --> 00:38:24,636
Bird seed.

570
00:38:26,262 --> 00:38:29,349
Oh. Yeah, yeah, yeah. Bird seed. Yeah.

571
00:38:30,642 --> 00:38:34,062
Well, I thought you were gonna
give me some kind of lecture,

572
00:38:34,145 --> 00:38:37,649
but yeah, chores are good.

573
00:38:40,527 --> 00:38:42,070
You don't need a lecture.

574
00:38:42,153 --> 00:38:43,863
You need perspective.

575
00:38:43,947 --> 00:38:46,616
[scoffs] Perspective, huh?

576
00:38:46,699 --> 00:38:48,952
There are eight billion people
on this planet

577
00:38:49,035 --> 00:38:51,162
and yet the gods chose you.

578
00:38:51,246 --> 00:38:53,248
Perhaps they saw your true potential

579
00:38:53,331 --> 00:38:54,916
- as a champion of Earthrealm.
- [sighs]

580
00:38:55,792 --> 00:38:57,335
Maybe they made a mistake.

581
00:38:57,418 --> 00:38:58,253
Maybe.

582
00:38:58,795 --> 00:39:01,923
If I see the Elder Gods,
I'll be sure to tell them.

583
00:39:06,678 --> 00:39:08,805
Well, I'm glad
you find this all so amusing.

584
00:39:10,056 --> 00:39:13,560
Hey, great pep talk, by the way.
Just nailed it.

585
00:39:18,398 --> 00:39:20,483
[pensive music playing]

586
00:39:26,364 --> 00:39:28,366
[rumbling]

587
00:39:43,548 --> 00:39:45,550
[crackling]

588
00:39:48,052 --> 00:39:50,013
[thunder crashing]

589
00:39:59,522 --> 00:40:00,523
Ouch.

590
00:40:01,983 --> 00:40:03,568
You have done this before?

591
00:40:04,569 --> 00:40:05,820
I've seen it done.

592
00:40:07,822 --> 00:40:09,157
[Sonya] All right.

593
00:40:14,287 --> 00:40:17,916
It's okay. The Princess Kitana
has been my eyes and ears

594
00:40:17,999 --> 00:40:19,959
inside the palace for many years now.

595
00:40:21,794 --> 00:40:23,755
We know the risk you took coming here.

596
00:40:23,838 --> 00:40:25,006
Thank you, Kitana.

597
00:40:25,089 --> 00:40:27,342
Wait, are you telling me
I got my ass kicked

598
00:40:27,425 --> 00:40:28,593
by one of the good guys?

599
00:40:28,676 --> 00:40:31,387
I had to make it look real.
He was watching.

600
00:40:32,555 --> 00:40:34,641
They found the Amulet of Shinnok.

601
00:40:34,724 --> 00:40:35,725
It was in the possession

602
00:40:35,808 --> 00:40:37,310
of a dead sellsword named Kano.

603
00:40:37,894 --> 00:40:39,520
Son of a bitch.

604
00:40:39,604 --> 00:40:41,272
If the Emperor finds a way
to charge the amulet,

605
00:40:41,356 --> 00:40:42,941
he would be unstoppable.

606
00:40:43,024 --> 00:40:44,734
It would be like fighting a god.

607
00:40:44,817 --> 00:40:47,278
Yeah, well, let's not do that.

608
00:40:48,071 --> 00:40:49,739
My friend is in the tournament.

609
00:40:50,990 --> 00:40:52,492
Jade was raised under Shao Kahn's army.

610
00:40:53,576 --> 00:40:57,455
Do what you must,
but do not make her suffer.

611
00:40:58,873 --> 00:41:00,166
[crackling]

612
00:41:09,759 --> 00:41:11,469
You went to another realm?

613
00:41:14,055 --> 00:41:15,556
You followed me?

614
00:41:15,640 --> 00:41:17,850
I am trying to keep you alive.

615
00:41:17,934 --> 00:41:18,935
By spying on your friend.

616
00:41:19,018 --> 00:41:21,646
By keeping my friend
from making a mistake.

617
00:41:21,729 --> 00:41:24,732
You are conspiring
with Lord Raiden. The enemy.

618
00:41:25,441 --> 00:41:27,527
I swore an oath, Kitana.

619
00:41:28,361 --> 00:41:31,864
To serve as Shao Kahn's sword.

620
00:41:39,497 --> 00:41:41,332
[Raiden] The second round
of the tournament

621
00:41:41,416 --> 00:41:42,917
will consist of three matches.

622
00:41:43,793 --> 00:41:46,629
Jax, Cole, Liu Kang.

623
00:41:53,845 --> 00:41:55,346
[metal slashes]

624
00:42:00,184 --> 00:42:01,185
[gasps]

625
00:42:03,980 --> 00:42:05,148
Kung Lao.

626
00:42:06,566 --> 00:42:08,276
I have been given new life.

627
00:42:09,527 --> 00:42:10,778
My son?

628
00:42:12,613 --> 00:42:13,698
[chiming]

629
00:42:14,699 --> 00:42:15,992
[energy pulsing]

630
00:42:20,038 --> 00:42:23,499
Look at that.
Still part of this tournament.

631
00:42:23,583 --> 00:42:25,334
But that's not why I'm here.

632
00:42:26,878 --> 00:42:29,130
[ominous choral music playing]

633
00:42:34,260 --> 00:42:36,220
No!

634
00:42:36,304 --> 00:42:37,430
No!

635
00:42:45,188 --> 00:42:46,773
[groaning]

636
00:42:49,067 --> 00:42:50,359
Attack now!

637
00:42:53,946 --> 00:42:55,156
[Sonya grunting]

638
00:42:55,907 --> 00:42:57,825
[tense music playing]

639
00:43:00,578 --> 00:43:01,579
[grunts]

640
00:43:05,458 --> 00:43:07,460
[choking]

641
00:43:18,346 --> 00:43:20,515
[grunting]

642
00:43:25,186 --> 00:43:26,813
[zaps]

643
00:43:28,731 --> 00:43:33,486
Imagine what one could do
with such power.

644
00:43:35,113 --> 00:43:39,450
[Shao Kahn] Careful, Sorcerer,
that doesn't belong to you.

645
00:43:47,041 --> 00:43:50,086
The amulet must be bound
to a mortal soul.

646
00:43:50,169 --> 00:43:52,046
Once it has imprinted on you,

647
00:43:52,130 --> 00:43:54,090
Raiden's power will be yours.

648
00:43:54,674 --> 00:43:57,051
The amulet will give you immortality.

649
00:43:57,135 --> 00:43:58,928
[amulet pulsing]

650
00:43:59,011 --> 00:44:01,139
[dramatic music playing]

651
00:44:01,973 --> 00:44:03,558
[Shao Kahn grunting]

652
00:44:09,313 --> 00:44:10,731
[Shao Kahn growls]

653
00:44:18,698 --> 00:44:21,576
[inhales, growls]

654
00:44:25,663 --> 00:44:27,623
[bubbling]

655
00:44:28,958 --> 00:44:30,960
[gate rattling]

656
00:44:31,043 --> 00:44:32,962
[suspenseful music playing]

657
00:44:36,841 --> 00:44:38,467
[growls]

658
00:44:56,277 --> 00:44:58,070
[portal whooshing]

659
00:45:00,948 --> 00:45:04,285
Well, this is fucking ominous.

660
00:45:06,704 --> 00:45:08,164
[portal whooshing]

661
00:45:11,292 --> 00:45:13,085
I'm guessing you're Jade.

662
00:45:13,169 --> 00:45:15,004
[Jade] Let's get this over with.

663
00:45:15,796 --> 00:45:16,797
[clangs]

664
00:45:18,591 --> 00:45:20,301
[suit pulsing]

665
00:45:20,384 --> 00:45:23,221
I am told you carry
the blood of Scorpion.

666
00:45:27,475 --> 00:45:29,268
I look forward to spilling it.

667
00:45:32,480 --> 00:45:33,314
[Jax yells]

668
00:45:44,158 --> 00:45:45,993
You know you're fighting
on the wrong side, right?

669
00:45:47,119 --> 00:45:48,120
[grunts]

670
00:45:54,835 --> 00:45:57,046
[staff clangs, pulsing]

671
00:45:57,129 --> 00:45:58,756
What the fuck do you have under there?

672
00:46:00,007 --> 00:46:01,634
Shit. [yells]

673
00:46:14,063 --> 00:46:15,439
[panting]

674
00:46:15,940 --> 00:46:16,983
[yells]

675
00:46:22,071 --> 00:46:22,989
Well, hello there.

676
00:46:25,616 --> 00:46:26,617
[yelling]

677
00:46:31,789 --> 00:46:34,125
[Shao Kahn] I hope
your ancestors are watching.

678
00:46:36,294 --> 00:46:38,004
[thrilling music playing]

679
00:46:46,387 --> 00:46:47,388
[Cole yells]

680
00:46:47,471 --> 00:46:48,889
[metal clangs]

681
00:46:51,100 --> 00:46:52,601
- [yells]
- [Shao Kahn grunts]

682
00:46:55,187 --> 00:46:56,522
[growls]

683
00:46:59,066 --> 00:47:00,067
[yells]

684
00:47:03,070 --> 00:47:04,071
[Jade yells]

685
00:47:05,948 --> 00:47:09,118
For what it is worth,
I take no joy in this.

686
00:47:12,038 --> 00:47:14,040
Then you're really going
to hate this shit.

687
00:47:15,166 --> 00:47:17,209
- [yells]
- [groans]

688
00:47:17,710 --> 00:47:18,711
[coughs]

689
00:47:19,420 --> 00:47:20,838
This is for my family.

690
00:47:22,089 --> 00:47:23,090
For my friends.

691
00:47:24,258 --> 00:47:25,718
For every moment that brought me here.

692
00:47:27,094 --> 00:47:30,473
This is for Earth, you son of a bitch.

693
00:47:31,974 --> 00:47:33,642
[dramatic choral music playing]

694
00:47:36,437 --> 00:47:37,772
[Cole grunts]

695
00:47:43,527 --> 00:47:44,737
[Shao Kahn grunts]

696
00:47:44,820 --> 00:47:46,238
[armor clanging]

697
00:47:48,366 --> 00:47:50,534
- [blade slicing]
- [blood splattering]

698
00:48:03,089 --> 00:48:04,382
[strains]

699
00:48:05,591 --> 00:48:07,009
[groans]

700
00:48:07,093 --> 00:48:09,095
[suit pulsing, powering up]

701
00:48:11,847 --> 00:48:13,224
[Shao Kahn screams]

702
00:48:14,141 --> 00:48:15,309
[Shao Kahn groans in pain]

703
00:48:15,393 --> 00:48:17,395
[squelching]

704
00:48:19,063 --> 00:48:20,022
[Cole] What?

705
00:48:20,523 --> 00:48:23,025
[Shao Kahn laughs]

706
00:48:24,193 --> 00:48:25,403
[gasps]

707
00:48:25,486 --> 00:48:26,737
[Shao Kahn yells]

708
00:48:28,906 --> 00:48:31,534
- [gasps]
- [squelching]

709
00:48:34,954 --> 00:48:36,539
[grunts]

710
00:48:42,461 --> 00:48:44,088
[liquid sizzles]

711
00:48:44,922 --> 00:48:46,715
Give my regards to the dead.

712
00:48:47,883 --> 00:48:48,884
[weapon splashing]

713
00:48:49,552 --> 00:48:50,970
[groans]

714
00:48:51,053 --> 00:48:52,596
[grunts, pants]

715
00:48:55,808 --> 00:48:58,436
Go on, do it.

716
00:49:22,126 --> 00:49:23,127
Why?

717
00:49:24,086 --> 00:49:25,754
Your friend spared one of our guys.

718
00:49:27,173 --> 00:49:28,090
Now we're even.

719
00:49:29,049 --> 00:49:31,760
By the way, hell of a fight.

720
00:49:34,513 --> 00:49:36,891
[energy warbling]

721
00:49:40,478 --> 00:49:42,396
[portal whooshing]

722
00:49:46,942 --> 00:49:49,278
[blade whirring, vibrating]

723
00:49:54,575 --> 00:49:57,536
Kung Lao, what have they done to you?

724
00:49:58,120 --> 00:49:59,997
Opened my eyes to the truth.

725
00:50:02,958 --> 00:50:03,959
What truth?

726
00:50:04,585 --> 00:50:08,589
Look around. The gods have
abandoned their creation.

727
00:50:09,507 --> 00:50:11,842
Only Shao Kahn can save us now.

728
00:50:12,801 --> 00:50:16,013
One of those gods raised you. Loved you.

729
00:50:17,431 --> 00:50:18,891
And you slit his throat.

730
00:50:22,061 --> 00:50:23,395
[grunts]

731
00:50:24,188 --> 00:50:25,147
[thuds]

732
00:50:25,231 --> 00:50:27,024
[tense music playing]

733
00:51:16,782 --> 00:51:18,200
[scraping]

734
00:51:22,871 --> 00:51:24,707
- [growls]
- [Liu Kang grunts]

735
00:51:24,790 --> 00:51:28,419
Stop. Kung Lao, remember who you are!

736
00:51:30,296 --> 00:51:31,880
You were my brother.

737
00:51:31,964 --> 00:51:34,675
And when you're dead,
when your realm falls,

738
00:51:35,384 --> 00:51:37,219
we will be brothers again.

739
00:51:37,303 --> 00:51:38,304
[straining]

740
00:51:39,513 --> 00:51:40,514
[grunts]

741
00:51:46,854 --> 00:51:48,939
[sinister choral music playing]

742
00:52:02,786 --> 00:52:04,204
Don't make me do this.

743
00:52:07,291 --> 00:52:08,917
[thrilling music playing]

744
00:52:38,530 --> 00:52:39,698
[straining]

745
00:52:40,908 --> 00:52:41,909
[grunts]

746
00:52:41,992 --> 00:52:43,911
[dramatic choral music playing]

747
00:53:06,433 --> 00:53:07,434
[clangs]

748
00:53:08,727 --> 00:53:09,728
[thuds]

749
00:53:15,025 --> 00:53:16,026
[whirring]

750
00:53:25,577 --> 00:53:27,037
I'll find a way to save you.

751
00:53:28,372 --> 00:53:29,373
[grunts]

752
00:53:32,126 --> 00:53:33,335
[grinding]

753
00:53:40,426 --> 00:53:42,344
I'm going to bring you back.

754
00:53:52,771 --> 00:53:53,772
[blow thuds]

755
00:53:56,650 --> 00:53:57,651
[squelching]

756
00:53:57,735 --> 00:53:59,528
[gurgling]

757
00:54:04,324 --> 00:54:06,326
[grinding stops]

758
00:54:11,165 --> 00:54:12,583
[groans, shudders]

759
00:54:18,046 --> 00:54:21,008
But not today, brother.

760
00:54:30,100 --> 00:54:31,935
[somber music playing]

761
00:54:40,861 --> 00:54:42,571
- [crackling]
- Raiden!

762
00:54:47,451 --> 00:54:50,621
- Is he?
- He's alive. Barely.

763
00:54:56,376 --> 00:54:57,836
He's been asking for you.

764
00:55:00,005 --> 00:55:01,006
[weakly] Liu Kang.

765
00:55:08,055 --> 00:55:09,097
My son.

766
00:55:09,681 --> 00:55:10,682
[exhales]

767
00:55:19,525 --> 00:55:20,526
What happened?

768
00:55:23,237 --> 00:55:24,279
I killed him.

769
00:55:25,572 --> 00:55:26,782
I didn't have a choice.

770
00:55:27,616 --> 00:55:28,617
I'm sorry.

771
00:55:33,205 --> 00:55:34,248
Where's Cole?

772
00:55:36,625 --> 00:55:37,835
He didn't come back?

773
00:55:41,046 --> 00:55:42,673
Oh, shit.

774
00:55:45,092 --> 00:55:46,009
[sighs]

775
00:55:54,643 --> 00:55:55,894
[Shao Kahn] Necromancer,

776
00:55:56,937 --> 00:55:59,189
give me your greatest warrior.

777
00:56:00,607 --> 00:56:02,609
The one they call Sub-Zero.

778
00:56:05,070 --> 00:56:07,072
[echoing] <i>Bi-Han.</i>

779
00:56:17,040 --> 00:56:18,876
[Quan Chi] <i>Rise now.</i>

780
00:56:22,129 --> 00:56:24,047
[sinister music playing]

781
00:56:31,346 --> 00:56:32,973
[Bi-Han] I am reborn.

782
00:56:34,182 --> 00:56:35,183
[crackling]

783
00:56:43,734 --> 00:56:46,028
[Kitana] Raiden's portal
is already weakening.

784
00:56:46,612 --> 00:56:48,488
It will not last when he is gone.

785
00:56:48,572 --> 00:56:50,157
Why would they take his powers?

786
00:56:50,240 --> 00:56:52,200
Shao Kahn has bonded with the amulet.

787
00:56:52,284 --> 00:56:53,994
Stolen the powers of a god.

788
00:56:54,077 --> 00:56:55,871
The only way to reverse the process

789
00:56:55,954 --> 00:56:57,497
is to destroy the amulet.

790
00:56:57,581 --> 00:56:59,833
Well, we'd better do it
before the next round starts.

