01:38:21,354 --> 01:38:23,106
[dramatic choral music playing]

1321
01:38:36,786 --> 01:38:40,081
It's time for them to see you
for what you really are.

1322
01:38:41,749 --> 01:38:42,875
[Kitana yells]

1323
01:38:48,214 --> 01:38:49,549
Mortal.

1324
01:38:51,592 --> 01:38:52,677
[screaming]

1325
01:38:53,511 --> 01:38:55,847
[whirring]

1326
01:39:05,106 --> 01:39:07,108
[indistinct chatter]

1327
01:39:12,238 --> 01:39:13,739
Stop. No.

1328
01:39:15,408 --> 01:39:18,786
Please stand. Stand. Please.

1329
01:39:26,043 --> 01:39:27,920
We are proud Edenians.

1330
01:39:29,297 --> 01:39:31,174
We do not kneel.

1331
01:39:37,680 --> 01:39:40,600
[woman chanting] Kitana, our queen!

1332
01:39:42,351 --> 01:39:45,771
Kitana, our queen!

1333
01:39:46,564 --> 01:39:50,026
[citizens chanting] Kitana, our queen!

1334
01:39:50,526 --> 01:39:52,737
[continues chanting]

1335
01:40:01,078 --> 01:40:02,330
[triumphant music playing]

1336
01:40:18,429 --> 01:40:20,223
[Johnny] <i>You want to know
what makes a hero?</i>

1337
01:40:22,141 --> 01:40:23,643
[sweeping music playing]

1338
01:40:25,102 --> 01:40:26,437
<i>It's not destiny.</i>

1339
01:40:27,146 --> 01:40:28,856
<i>It's not something you're born with.</i>

1340
01:40:31,317 --> 01:40:33,402
<i>It's discovering that sometimes</i>

1341
01:40:33,486 --> 01:40:34,946
<i>even one small light</i>

1342
01:40:35,029 --> 01:40:37,406
<i>is enough to hold back the darkness.</i>

1343
01:40:39,116 --> 01:40:40,785
<i>It's facing unimaginable loss...</i>

1344
01:40:43,454 --> 01:40:46,082
<i>and finding peace on the other side.</i>

1345
01:40:55,299 --> 01:40:57,843
<i>It's lifting up
the ones you love, knowing...</i>

1346
01:41:00,888 --> 01:41:04,392
<i>that they'll be there
to catch you when you fall.</i>

1347
01:41:10,773 --> 01:41:12,608
<i>It's searching for greatness,</i>

1348
01:41:15,069 --> 01:41:18,948
<i>then realizing you've had it
in you this entire time.</i>

1349
01:41:20,866 --> 01:41:22,952
I say all of this to Raiden

1350
01:41:23,035 --> 01:41:26,414
and he looks at me and he says...

1351
01:41:27,123 --> 01:41:31,919
[imitating Raiden] "You...
You have taught us so much, Mr. Cage.

1352
01:41:32,920 --> 01:41:37,091
Thank you. Thank you
for sharing your wisdom."

1353
01:41:38,050 --> 01:41:39,760
And you know what I tell him?

1354
01:41:40,344 --> 01:41:41,596
What did you say?

1355
01:41:42,138 --> 01:41:44,140
I said, "That ain't no wisdom, bub.

1356
01:41:44,640 --> 01:41:47,310
That's perspective."

1357
01:41:47,935 --> 01:41:49,270
[children laugh]

1358
01:41:49,353 --> 01:41:52,523
[Raiden] Strange.
That is not how I remember it.

1359
01:41:53,691 --> 01:41:55,026
Oh. Yo.

1360
01:41:55,693 --> 01:41:57,445
I was just telling these guys

1361
01:41:57,528 --> 01:42:00,197
how we saved all the realms, together.

1362
01:42:00,281 --> 01:42:01,407
Oh.

1363
01:42:01,907 --> 01:42:02,908
[Johnny] All right. Look...

1364
01:42:03,659 --> 01:42:07,246
I may have taken one or two
creative liberties.

1365
01:42:08,039 --> 01:42:09,040
Behold!

1366
01:42:09,540 --> 01:42:12,918
The human female you rescued
from the pit of spikes.

1367
01:42:13,794 --> 01:42:14,712
Seriously?

1368
01:42:15,379 --> 01:42:17,131
Two or three creative liberties.

1369
01:42:17,632 --> 01:42:18,758
[Sonya] You know,
I've got to give it to you,

1370
01:42:18,841 --> 01:42:20,551
I thought you'd go
running back to Hollywood

1371
01:42:20,635 --> 01:42:21,636
first chance you got.

1372
01:42:21,719 --> 01:42:23,888
I made a promise to these guys.

1373
01:42:23,971 --> 01:42:25,514
Hollywood can wait.

1374
01:42:25,598 --> 01:42:26,599
[portal whooshing]

1375
01:42:27,600 --> 01:42:28,601
[Johnny] Oh, shit.

1376
01:42:29,685 --> 01:42:31,020
Tell me there's not another tournament.

1377
01:42:31,103 --> 01:42:33,272
No. Outworld has been defeated.

1378
01:42:33,356 --> 01:42:34,523
Earthrealm has been saved.

1379
01:42:35,691 --> 01:42:38,653
So, uh, what the fuck
are you doing here?

1380
01:42:38,736 --> 01:42:41,405
We have lost far too many
of our champions.

1381
01:42:41,489 --> 01:42:43,449
It's time to bring them home.

1382
01:42:43,532 --> 01:42:44,825
[lightning crackles]

1383
01:42:45,701 --> 01:42:47,411
Someone order a Necromancer?

1384
01:42:47,995 --> 01:42:49,997
He might look like Voldemort's nut sack,

1385
01:42:50,081 --> 01:42:52,416
but trust me, we're going
to need this fucker.

1386
01:42:53,751 --> 01:42:57,088
Hey, g'day, Blondie. Long time no see.

1387
01:42:58,339 --> 01:43:00,049
You ready for your next lesson?

1388
01:43:00,132 --> 01:43:02,510
For the glory of Johnny Fucking Cage.

1389
01:43:04,095 --> 01:43:05,471
[Baraka grunts]

1390
01:43:06,013 --> 01:43:08,683
Let's go get our friends.
Then we kill Kano.

1391
01:43:10,851 --> 01:43:12,311
Yeah. Good.

1392
01:43:12,395 --> 01:43:13,854
[heroic music playing]

1393
